# Row polymorphism: function that extends a record
# Takes any record with at least `name: String` and adds an `id` field.
# The open record annotation `...` allows extra fields (here: age: 30).
[f: [fn [r@[name: String ...]] [call $merge $r [id: 1]]]
 result: [call $f [name: alice  age: 30]]]
===
Dict({"f": Function(r), "result": Dict({"name": String("alice"), "age": Int(30), "id": Int(1)})})
